# SCPN Levitated Dipole Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Levitated Dipole Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the levitated-dipole configuration
  within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group. Evidence maturity
  computational_prototype: a validated device configuration model,
  diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN Phase Orchestrator
  observability catalogue, level-0 device physics of the levitated coil (the
  coil as a magnet, its levitation, its inductive charging and the confined
  plasma) in closed form, and tessellated and B-rep models of the coil set
  in its two arrangements. All parameter sets are synthetic; no real machine
  is described, and the claim inventory is empty.
authors:
